{"id":307,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究型学習と国際教育で学びを深める昌平中","feature_description":"昌平中学校は、国際バカロレアのMYPを取り入れ、教科をつなぐ探究学習や課題解決型の学びを進めています。生徒が問いを立て、調べ、考えをまとめて発表する活動を通じ、知識を活用する力と主体性を育てます。英語を含む国際教育と結び付け、多様な考え方を尊重しながら学ぶ姿勢を養います。各教科の知識を結びつけて学ぶことも重視し、学びを深めます。","clubs":[{"id":5455,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5456,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5457,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5458,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5459,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5460,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5461,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5462,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":5463,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14112,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14113,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shohei.sugito.saitama.jp/contents/jhs/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-